  {
    "name": "GlyGen_search_glycoproteins",
    "description": "Search GlyGen for glycoproteins by organism, glycosylation evidence/type, protein name, or gene name with one-based offset pagination. Returns matching proteins with glycosylation-site counts and relevance scores. Response metadata exposes total_results, returned_count, has_more, and next_offset; follow next_offset for complete retrieval.",
    "parameter": {
      "type": "object",
